# Never ship host installs/builds into the image — containers install and
# build themselves; host node_modules (Windows junctions into a host pnpm
# store) would clobber the in-image links after COPY.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
.git
.github
e2e
web/android
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
coverage
claude.resume